{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:25:17Z","created_by_operation":"op_55462cb4c6484827b9b7f5719aa858eb","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_7f428ee8bfe61832784054a38a4c543e48f72ac63446599ec62c647e154d5a4d","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=skills-patterns","setting":"xiaomimimo/mimo-code@6fbb1732232c snapshot d96a162cc3e28c0a","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_5286e377423ad87449ffc99f318cc28e550dffd962c354d70dcb614a30315b34","slc_c7354edf71b179e4a4b0c12ee2da545a57d4a20682ed1b06a9cf6cfb2957e384"],"source_ids":["src_90482fc645e750f795208ff2bb5d75a2"],"text":"Environment variables can disable builtin skills entirely, disable only office/media skills, or hide skills from TUI autocomplete while keeping them available to agents.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:25:17Z","updated_by_operation":"op_55462cb4c6484827b9b7f5719aa858eb"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:25:17Z","created_by_operation":"op_55462cb4c6484827b9b7f5719aa858eb","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_82691afaae0191369c8dd1789400850834a02aa9753aa0437663f423b5adc04e","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"xiaomimimo/mimo-code@6fbb1732232c snapshot d96a162cc3e28c0a","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_3cb2614f5ec2f84f589a3d8add07b76bdb86590953fbf5180f3db0c8c3cfaef0","slc_bc2f9b43ab16889b84a15dd1da7062545bc09679d63e29c950f1b39acf417077"],"source_ids":["src_90482fc645e750f795208ff2bb5d75a2"],"text":"Three primary agents exist: build (full permissions), plan (read-only analysis), and compose (specs-driven orchestration); Tab switches agents, and Compose is isolated once entered.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:25:17Z","updated_by_operation":"op_55462cb4c6484827b9b7f5719aa858eb"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:25:17Z","created_by_operation":"op_55462cb4c6484827b9b7f5719aa858eb","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_9ec3c9d8c154fe705756b3126d4cc1c602d52c637b48deb43ba3b143e9817255","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"xiaomimimo/mimo-code@6fbb1732232c snapshot d96a162cc3e28c0a","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_432fa95a545e819dddaf47b1350b26f2ee29780bacbfb64d959f4fdfdc3021f8"],"source_ids":["src_90482fc645e750f795208ff2bb5d75a2"],"text":"MiMoCode is built as a fork of OpenCode, retaining core capabilities (multiple providers, TUI, LSP, MCP, plugins) and adding memory, context management, subagents, goal loops, and dream/distill self-improvement.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:25:17Z","updated_by_operation":"op_55462cb4c6484827b9b7f5719aa858eb"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:25:17Z","created_by_operation":"op_55462cb4c6484827b9b7f5719aa858eb","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_a6020a5783bf3448215b073d5bff068ebc49ad23fd49d7a4445298d153c5b87b","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"xiaomimimo/mimo-code@6fbb1732232c snapshot d96a162cc3e28c0a","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_5544f98d598e06ef1a7ed051dbc45ef78a17d43bd23e4657ed12fedacb3cb8d8"],"source_ids":["src_90482fc645e750f795208ff2bb5d75a2"],"text":"MiMoCode is a terminal-native AI coding assistant that reads/writes code, runs commands, manages Git, and maintains persistent project memory across sessions.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:25:17Z","updated_by_operation":"op_55462cb4c6484827b9b7f5719aa858eb"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:25:17Z","created_by_operation":"op_55462cb4c6484827b9b7f5719aa858eb","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_ad593f13fd32fd787e180bf3843be20f9fee51c21cd55ba0eda850dadaafbc0a","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"xiaomimimo/mimo-code@6fbb1732232c snapshot d96a162cc3e28c0a","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_c25eff7611171915d2831628cf28e1f9471059f290c7fcac9a51ac2d07d24579"],"source_ids":["src_90482fc645e750f795208ff2bb5d75a2"],"text":"The primary agent can spawn subagents that share session context, run in parallel, and support lifecycle tracking, cancellation, and background execution.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:25:17Z","updated_by_operation":"op_55462cb4c6484827b9b7f5719aa858eb"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:25:17Z","created_by_operation":"op_55462cb4c6484827b9b7f5719aa858eb","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_aed6f2a21a33d1228adcbb99fc28a99428e395453071a4559c24e6db87d443a4","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"xiaomimimo/mimo-code@6fbb1732232c snapshot d96a162cc3e28c0a","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_93b177cd268b4780fbcee9de2f48e1f1d2268ac62f7cc17342c742f54837f335","slc_af4bd38dc20e6f1bfbd43cc9619d8f6ee48f60aa800a650ba90b6f869fb75b34"],"source_ids":["src_90482fc645e750f795208ff2bb5d75a2"],"text":"Voice input requires the sox dependency and is available to MiMo logged-in users; the ASR model mimo-v2.5-asr is only on MiMo's platform while voice control works via OpenRouter-compatible providers.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:25:17Z","updated_by_operation":"op_55462cb4c6484827b9b7f5719aa858eb"}
